    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omukhasi nende okuyokha",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana eshilolelo eshiamakana shialolekha mwikulu; mbu omukhasi owali niyeefwalile eliuba, omwesi nikuli hasi wamakuluke, ne khumurwe yali nolusimbi Iwetsinyininyini ekhuminatsibili ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne yali nali inda; ne niyayula, nalumungwa okhwibula, nasaalila khulwa inumwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana eshilolelo shiamakana shindi nashio nishilolekha mwikulumbu lola, okuyokha okukhongo okwakhanyu ngwokwo, nikuli nemirwe musaafu nende tsinzika ekhumi; ne khumirwe chiakwo bialikhwo ebimwata musaafu biobwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omushila kwakwo nikukhwesa eshitonye shiokhutaru shietsinyininyini etsiomwikulu nikutsisukuna khushialo; okuyokha nikusinjiia imbeli womukhasi oyo owali nal i okhwibula, mbu niyakheebula, kulie omwanawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukhasi niyeebula omwana omusiani, oyo ouliruka amahanga kosi neindabushi yeshibia; naye omwanawe yakaamwa nayilwa ewaNyasaye, khandi khushifumbishie shioburuchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukhasi naye niyeelukha natsia mushitsiimi ewa yali nahabunduwe aha Nyasaye yamukasilia, mbu aliisilibungweyo tsindaalo eshikhumila ebikhumi bibili namakhumi kasasaba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana lihe nilibaho mwikulu; mbu Mikaeli nabamalaikabe nibaseera okuyokha. Okuyokha nakwo nikubaseera, halala nabamalaika bakwo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "habula shibahula ta, kata habundu wabwe shihatong'akhwo mwikulu khandi tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakwo okuyokha okukhongo okwo nikuhangulusibwa hasi; inzokha eyo yakhale, oyo oulangwa mbu Ibilisi, khandi Setani, omukaatii oukaatinjia eshialo shiosi; yahangulusibwa hasi khushialo, abamalaikabe nibasukunwayo halala ninaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana ndahulila omwoyo omukhongo mwikulu, nikuboola mbu Bulaano buno obuhonia bwaNyasaye weefwe buulile, nobunyalibwe nobwamibwe, khandi nende oburuchi bwaKristowe; okhuba omwinjilili wabaana beefwe wasukuunwe hasi, oyo oubeenjililanga imbeli waNyasaye weefwe, eshilo neshiteere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne bamuhula khulwa amabanga keLikondi, khandi khulwa likhuwa liobuloli elia barumbuule; ne shibaheela obulamu bwabwe ta, kata okhuula khukhufwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khulwako, wikhoye, iwe Likulu, nineenywe abamenyangamwo. Woowe khwinywe, eshialo nende inyanza! Okhuba Setani wayeeshile, weenjiile mwinywe, nali noburima obunji, namanyile shinga induukhoye olwa yili inyimbichiti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa okuyokha kwalola shinga olwa kwahangulusibwa khushialo, kwamusakania omukhasi oyo owali niyeebuule omwana omusiani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana omukhasi tsana yaheebwa tsimbaha tsibili tsieinditsu ikhongo eyo, mbu apulushe atsie mushitsiimi, habunduwe ewa aliisilibungwa eshise nende ebise nende inusu yeshise, arule imbeli weinzokha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inzokha yarusia amatsi mumunwa kwayo shinga omwalo, inyuma womukhasi, mbu kamuyuule nemikhula chiako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne eshialo shiamuhabina omukhasi, eshialo nishiasama omunwa nishimila omwalo okwo okwa okuyokha kwarusia mumunwa kwakwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakwo okuyokha nikutiililwa omukhasi oyo oburima, nikurulaho nikutsia okhuseera abaanabe bandi bosi, abahulilanga amalako kaNyasaye nibahanda khumakhuwa akarumbulwa khu Yesu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
